      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KAIYA (1) was safely held on debut when eighth (24.02) at this track over 400m. Has the inside box this time. Can get off the mark this time. BYRON BLITZ (4) is a first starter from the Joseph Mcfadyen yard by Fabregas out of Spritz. Start all important from the squeeze box. Lot to like about her profile and expected to run well. MY PARTY PIE (5) turned in a plain effort last time when sixth at this track over 400m behind Princess Docker (24.04) in a Maiden. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Should be in this for a long way. WICKED BLAZE (2) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can make amends.",
